@startuml
skinparam dpi 220
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title Alternativa Descartada: San Camilo en Línea con Microservicios

actor "Cliente / Comerciante / Repartidor" as U
node "API Gateway" as GW

package "Microservicios (Despliegues Independientes)" {
  [Catálogo] as C
  [Pedidos] as P
  [Pagos] as PA
  [Entregas] as E
  [Notificaciones] as N
}

queue "Broker de Eventos" as MQ
database "BD Catálogo" as DB1
database "BD Pedidos" as DB2
database "BD Pagos" as DB3
database "BD Entregas" as DB4
cloud "Yape" as Y
cloud "WhatsApp API" as W

U --> GW
GW --> C
GW --> P
GW --> E

C --> DB1
P --> DB2
PA --> DB3
E --> DB4

P ..> MQ : Publica
MQ ..> PA
MQ ..> E
MQ ..> N

PA --> Y
N --> W

note bottom of MQ
  **Motivo de rechazo (Matriz de decisión):**
  Aunque favorece la escalabilidad independiente, exige
  múltiples despliegues y bases de datos. Es inviable para
  el plazo de 1 mes (R-01) y nuestro equipo de 3 desarrolladores.
end note
@enduml